WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.659 --> 00:00:15.379
When Zann arrived at the swamp, Darb was waiting.

2
00:00:15.819 --> 00:00:16.580
So was Gliss.

3
00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:18.780
Zann was still mad at Gliss.

4
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.241
But he tried not to let those feelings show.

5
00:00:22.061 --> 00:00:25.382
After today he might not see his friends for a long time.

6
00:00:26.182 --> 00:00:28.283
In fact, he might never see them again.

7
00:00:28.803 --> 00:00:30.423
He didn't want to leave on bad terms.

8
00:00:31.324 --> 00:00:32.584
Gliss smiled uncertainly.

9
00:00:34.612 --> 00:00:34.832
"Hi, Zann."

10
00:00:34.852 --> 00:00:35.173
"Hi, Gliss."

11
00:00:35.633 --> 00:00:36.914
Zann smiled back briefly.

12
00:00:37.614 --> 00:00:38.995
Then he turned toward Darb.

13
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:40.717
"I need a favor.

14
00:00:41.117 --> 00:00:43.138
Can you watch Zing for a few hours?"

15
00:00:43.158 --> 00:00:45.200
"Sure," Darb said.

16
00:00:45.220 --> 00:00:46.501
"Why? What's up?"

17
00:00:47.281 --> 00:00:53.066
"Right before the trouble with Morb started, I told Professor Nurt I'd do some extra credit work for

18
00:00:53.146 --> 00:00:55.668
Food and Drink Creation class," Zann said.

19
00:00:55.688 --> 00:00:59.090
"I need to finish it before school starts tomorrow."

20
00:01:00.231 --> 00:01:01.372
Gliss looked surprised.

21
00:01:01.716 --> 00:01:04.639
"I doubt Professor Nurt will care about that," she said.

22
00:01:04.659 --> 00:01:07.361
"Everyone knows you've been kind of busy."

23
00:01:08.322 --> 00:01:09.382
Zann forced a laugh.

24
00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:12.085
"I know.

25
00:01:12.565 --> 00:01:14.086
But I still want to do it."

26
00:01:15.027 --> 00:01:16.328
"Wow." Darb grinned.

27
00:01:16.348 --> 00:01:18.910
"Saving Magica must have changed you, Zann.

28
00:01:19.671 --> 00:01:21.752
You never cared that much about schoolwork before."

29
00:01:21.772 --> 00:01:24.355
"Ha-ha, very funny."

30
00:01:25.295 --> 00:01:26.156
Zann was nervous.

31
00:01:26.536 --> 00:01:28.038
Were his friends suspicious?

32
00:01:28.798 --> 00:01:30.780
Maybe he should have thought of a different cover story.

33
00:01:31.724 --> 00:01:37.287
"Anyway, it will be easier to create puffberry soufflés without Zing there trying to eat them."

34
00:01:38.088 --> 00:01:38.688
"No problem."

35
00:01:38.908 --> 00:01:40.149
Darb gave Zing a pat.

36
00:01:40.669 --> 00:01:41.309
"We'll have fun.

37
00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:42.070
Right, buddy?"

38
00:01:42.950 --> 00:01:45.432
Usually Zing loved spending time with Darb.

39
00:01:46.132 --> 00:01:49.774
But today he ignored him, staying pressed against Zann's leg.

40
00:01:49.794 --> 00:01:52.015
"What's wrong with him?"

41
00:01:52.295 --> 00:01:52.876
Gliss wondered.

42
00:01:52.896 --> 00:01:55.657
"Nothing." Zann gave Zing a nudge.

43
00:01:56.157 --> 00:01:57.338
"Go with Darb, boy."

44
00:01:58.178 --> 00:02:00.780
The dragon whined and emitted a puff of smoke.

45
00:02:01.732 --> 00:02:05.095
Zing refused to leave Zann's side even when Darb called him.

46
00:02:05.916 --> 00:02:09.379
Finally Zann snapped his fingers and created a dragon harness.

47
00:02:10.060 --> 00:02:14.163
He slipped it onto Zing's scaly body and then handed the leash to Darb.

48
00:02:14.183 --> 00:02:17.306
"I'm sure he'll be fine once I'm gone.

49
00:02:17.806 --> 00:02:21.350
He's just annoyed because he knows he'll be missing all those soufflés."

50
00:02:22.330 --> 00:02:23.031
Darb chuckled.

51
00:02:23.051 --> 00:02:25.073
"You're probably right."

52
00:02:25.914 --> 00:02:29.264
But he looked concerned as he glanced at Zing.

53
00:02:29.284 --> 00:02:32.466
Zann didn't want to give his friends the chance to ask any more questions.

54
00:02:32.486 --> 00:02:34.386
"Thanks," he said.

55
00:02:34.406 --> 00:02:36.007
"See you in a few hours."

56
00:02:36.907 --> 00:02:37.708
He zapped home.

57
00:02:39.889 --> 00:02:44.131
Soon he was stepping out of his room with his backpack strapped onto his shoulders.

58
00:02:45.051 --> 00:02:48.092
He reached into his pocket to make sure the message stone was there.

59
00:02:48.833 --> 00:02:52.094
As he touched its cool, hard surface, he shivered.

60
00:02:52.594 --> 00:02:53.915
What was he getting himself into?

61
00:02:54.615 --> 00:02:56.036
But he couldn't lose his nerve now.

62
00:02:56.924 --> 00:03:00.567
After taking one last look around the house, Zann hurried outside.

63
00:03:01.728 --> 00:03:04.850
He'd already decided to walk to the wormhole instead of zapping there.

64
00:03:05.770 --> 00:03:10.013
It wasn't far, and he would need all his energy for navigating the vortex.

65
00:03:10.854 --> 00:03:16.258
Just as he reached the clearing, the wormhole let out a magical burp that rattled the branches of

66
00:03:16.338 --> 00:03:18.279
nearby trees and made Zann jump.

67
00:03:19.180 --> 00:03:20.421
Could he really do this?

68
00:03:20.441 --> 00:03:23.323
"Yes," he whispered.

69
00:03:23.343 --> 00:03:24.944
"I have to do it."

70
00:03:25.836 --> 00:03:28.857
Taking a deep breath, Zann stepped toward the wormhole.

71
00:03:29.697 --> 00:03:35.199
Its ragged mouth opened wider, and its chaotic energy reached out and began to suck him in.

72
00:03:35.219 --> 00:03:37.979
"Zann!" someone shouted.

73
00:03:38.719 --> 00:03:41.140
It was Perda, and she sounded angry.

74
00:03:41.160 --> 00:03:45.181
"You didn't think you really tricked me with that pathetic story, did you?"

75
00:03:46.362 --> 00:03:48.202
Zann tried to pull away from the wormhole.

76
00:03:48.622 --> 00:03:50.063
But its pull was too strong.

77
00:03:50.083 --> 00:03:52.643
"Perda, no!

78
00:03:52.683 --> 00:03:53.764
You have to get back!"

79
00:03:54.744 --> 00:03:55.364
"No way."

80
00:03:56.000 --> 00:04:00.262
Perda rubbed her fingers together with one hand while she grabbed Zann's wrist with the other.

81
00:04:01.143 --> 00:04:05.505
A second later a glowing band of energy appeared, linking their wrists together.

82
00:04:05.525 --> 00:04:07.626
"A Shackle spell?"

83
00:04:07.847 --> 00:04:08.647
Zann blurted out.

84
00:04:08.667 --> 00:04:10.408
"Where'd you learn to do that?"

85
00:04:10.428 --> 00:04:12.849
"I'm full of surprises."

86
00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.631
She smirked, tugging at the magical shackles to test them.

87
00:04:16.651 --> 00:04:19.733
"Now you can't leave me behind!"

88
00:04:20.814 --> 00:04:24.616
Zann gritted his teeth, trying again to escape the wormhole's pull.

89
00:04:25.336 --> 00:04:26.176
But it was no use.

90
00:04:26.697 --> 00:04:28.717
It was all he could do to stay where he was.

91
00:04:29.818 --> 00:04:33.459
He had to convince Perda to back off before she got sucked in too!

92
00:04:34.340 --> 00:04:35.500
"Listen," he said.

93
00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:39.702
"I didn't want to lie to you, but—" "Then why did you?"

94
00:04:40.002 --> 00:04:40.702
she shot back.

95
00:04:41.543 --> 00:04:45.304
"Perda, I—" Before he could go on, Gliss burst into view.

96
00:04:45.324 --> 00:04:46.905
"Oh no!"

97
00:04:47.345 --> 00:04:48.926
she cried as she saw the wormhole.

98
00:04:48.946 --> 00:04:51.006
"What are you two doing?

99
00:04:51.527 --> 00:04:52.467
Are you crazy?"

100
00:04:53.587 --> 00:04:55.292
Zann glared at Perda.

101
00:04:55.312 --> 00:04:57.134
"Did you tell everyone I was here?"

102
00:04:57.154 --> 00:05:00.036
"I didn't tell anyone," Perda said.

103
00:05:00.056 --> 00:05:01.978
"I don't know what she's doing here."

104
00:05:01.998 --> 00:05:04.259
"I zapped to your house, Zann."

105
00:05:05.040 --> 00:05:08.863
Gliss took a step closer while keeping a wary eye on the wormhole.

106
00:05:08.883 --> 00:05:10.945
"I wanted to talk to you.

107
00:05:11.605 --> 00:05:14.327
I saw you rushing off down the street, so I followed.

108
00:05:15.208 --> 00:05:16.309
Now I'm glad I did.

109
00:05:16.649 --> 00:05:19.712
You can't do this—it's way too dangerous!"

110
00:05:19.732 --> 00:05:22.334
"Too late," Perda said.

111
00:05:22.354 --> 00:05:24.736
"We're going, and you can't stop us!"

112
00:05:25.744 --> 00:05:26.564
Gliss frowned.

113
00:05:26.584 --> 00:05:27.965
"Oh yeah?"

114
00:05:29.185 --> 00:05:33.367
She stepped forward and grabbed Perda's free arm, trying to drag her back.

115
00:05:33.387 --> 00:05:35.348
"Don't be stupid!"

116
00:05:35.368 --> 00:05:36.769
"Get back!"

117
00:05:37.289 --> 00:05:39.410
Zann was still struggling to hold his position.

118
00:05:39.430 --> 00:05:42.331
"The wormhole's energy is too strong.

119
00:05:42.751 --> 00:05:44.032
You'll get sucked in with us!"

120
00:05:45.332 --> 00:05:47.213
Just then he heard a familiar whistle.

121
00:05:48.013 --> 00:05:52.075
Zing! The dragon flew at Zann with a blast of irritated flame.

122
00:05:52.895 --> 00:05:54.736
His harness was trailing behind him.

123
00:05:56.748 --> 00:05:57.108
"Zing, no!"

124
00:05:57.128 --> 00:05:59.990
Perda exclaimed, ducking her head to avoid the fire.

125
00:06:00.010 --> 00:06:02.471
"Zing! Where are you going?"

126
00:06:02.791 --> 00:06:04.492
Darb called, rushing into sight.

127
00:06:05.333 --> 00:06:07.314
He gasped when he saw what was happening.

128
00:06:08.155 --> 00:06:09.896
"Hurry!" Gliss called to Darb.

129
00:06:09.916 --> 00:06:12.777
"Help me pull Zann and Perda out!"

130
00:06:13.938 --> 00:06:16.079
Darb jumped forward, grabbing onto Gliss.

131
00:06:16.840 --> 00:06:20.682
At the same time, Zing latched onto Zann's backpack with his claws.

132
00:06:21.402 --> 00:06:24.224
Zann felt the wormhole's hold on him loosen slightly.

133
00:06:25.228 --> 00:06:26.451
"Fine, I give up!"

134
00:06:26.691 --> 00:06:27.272
Zann called.

135
00:06:27.292 --> 00:06:31.259
"Everyone pull back together, and—" Whoosh!

136
00:06:31.820 --> 00:06:37.872
Energy suddenly expanded and contracted, sucking the whole group into the wormhole's gaping mouth.
